{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build and manage your dream ranch together with friends in cozy co-op! Raise unique animals, each with their own traits and possible mutations. Gather fresh resources, sell your products, and turn your ranch into a thriving business. Customize every corner, hire workers to help you grow, and expand step by step as your peaceful little farm comes to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3998460/extras/361c1a78e7e16f4a3e8efcd90adaf081.webp?t=1762772240\" width=258 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feed, grow, and look after a variety of farm animals. Keep them healthy and happy to produce valuable resources.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3998460/extras/d91acd8a3bf9e7b8e4169205046107e0.poster.avif?t=1762772240\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3998460/extras/d91acd8a3bf9e7b8e4169205046107e0.webm?t=1762772240\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3998460/extras/d91acd8a3bf9e7b8e4169205046107e0.mp4?t=1762772240\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3998460/extras/edbe676f734aa5cba95c4d30ae29e488.webp?t=1762772240\" width=258 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Either buy food from local farmers in the city, or grow your own fruits and vegetables for a more cost-effective option. Manage your crops, collect harvests, and keep your animals happy and fed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3998460/extras/a525718bf68d0269db658afef3c5c150.poster.avif?t=1762772240\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3998460/extras/a525718bf68d0269db658afef3c5c150.webm?t=1762772240\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3998460/extras/a525718bf68d0269db658afef3c5c150.mp4?t=1762772240\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3998460/extras/1a8eacc3edb072c59d3972408a7132a6.webp?t=1762772240\" width=258 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect various animal originated resources from your animals like milk, wool, meat, eggs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3998460/extras/48c1391ff8715fa878a802f8adce8a38.poster.avif?t=1762772240\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3998460/extras/48c1391ff8715fa878a802f8adce8a38.webm?t=1762772240\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3998460/extras/48c1391ff8715fa878a802f8adce8a38.mp4?t=1762772240\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3998460/extras/2be389c4861a4ee1b1cfdce8d04ffd9a.webp?t=1762772240\" wi